{"id":"646525","name":"全麦馒头","author":"宸·羽","authorId":"7796837","desc":"","cover":"images/646525/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"全麦面粉","amount":"500g"}],"sub":[{"name":"干酵母粉","amount":"5g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"全麦面粉。","img":"images/646525/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"盆中倒入面粉，加入酵母粉和糖。","img":"images/646525/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"加入温开水。","img":"images/646525/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"揉搓成形后加入猪油。","img":"images/646525/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"和成光滑的面团。","img":"images/646525/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"盖上保鲜膜，温室发酵30分钟。","img":"images/646525/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"面团发酵至两倍大。","img":"images/646525/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"发的很好呢。","img":"images/646525/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放入面垫，揉搓排气。","img":"images/646525/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"再搓成长条。","img":"images/646525/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"切成等量的小面剂。","img":"images/646525/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"再揉成光滑圆形的小面团。","img":"images/646525/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"放入锅内，再次发酵20分钟。","img":"images/646525/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"二次发酵完毕，开大火蒸15分钟。","img":"images/646525/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"时间到，焖3~5分钟再开盖，蓬松宣软，香甜好吃。","img":"images/646525/step_15.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}